const steps=[["Input","One topic or short question, 2–60 characters and no more than 160 UTF-8 bytes. URLs, files, line breaks and extra request fields are rejected."],["Human check","Cloudflare Turnstile must pass before quota or budget is reserved."],["Native provider","Choose OpenAI GPT-5.6 Luna or Gemini 3.7 Flash. The server calls the provider directly; no provider key reaches the browser."],["Real web-search run","OpenAI receives the built-in web_search tool with low search context. Gemini receives google_search. The fixed public instruction asks the model to search naturally and answer briefly; provider output is capped at 500 tokens so the search tool can complete reliably."],["Observed output only","The parser returns only query strings and cited source URLs present in the provider response. If the API exposes no query string, the result says so instead of inventing one."],["No raw server archive","The server keeps the topic and provider response transient. A visitor can explicitly save up to 20 visible results in IndexedDB on that device for 30 days and delete them at any time."],["Hard limits","Twenty attempts per hashed IP bucket in a rolling 24-hour window and 40 site-wide per UTC day. The tool shows remaining runs and the bucket reset time after use. Native requests reserve EUR 0.10 inside the shared EUR 25 soft and EUR 30 hard monthly limits. This is a conservative internal safety amount, not provider billing; exact spend remains in the provider account."],["Separate ideas mode","Search Ideas uses OpenRouter to generate ten modelled directions without web search. It is not called native or controlled fanout."]];
